    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Old Dalton's death and Shelly freezing in the cold storage were no accidents..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Now Michael and Marion are dead too, in such a horrible way..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Who's behind all this? Why all the murders in the first place? And why are they so... gruesome?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#4$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "I have a feeling that Michael saw this coming."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "He looked a lot more serious than usual when we met the night before the murder."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "He must've figured out the real reason Dalton died, panicked, and decided to get out of here, but..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Now we'll never know what he was hiding."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Maybe this all has to do with that accident five years ago, but what's really worrying me is that..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "The killer's not even trying to make them look like accidents anymore. What if they're trying to tell us\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "That until the entire truth is brought to light, nobody is safe."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#3$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Omigosh, sorry Molly, did my babbling scare you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Don't worry, it doesn't matter if there really is, like, a crazy killer running out there, I'll protect you no matter how many of them there are."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#9$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "Oh, that's not it, Detective Tippi. I was just thinking about... what I can do on my end."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "Michael's dead now, but that doesn't mean what he wanted me to do doesn't matter anymore."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "The killer might be planning on using the escape landboats Miss Stone mentioned for their next move..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "So if we can figure another way out, or put together something that'll get us to the ground, or even just find an exhaust vent..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "We might be able to get away from this maniac hiding in the shadows and save ourselves during the climax."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Molly..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#9$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "Tippi, you were the first person to really open up to me after I joined the crew."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "Even though I kept messing up and getting you into trouble, you were always there to stand up for me. When Marion would forget my name, you were always ready to give her a proper reminder."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "You're always looking after me, comforting me, protecting me..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "So this time, I want to protect you too."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "posfrom": "0,0",
            "posto": "100,0",
            "duration": 1
        }
    },
