            "duration": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "I'm terribly sorry to interrupt your little sorority huddle."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Oh, wow, Miss Rutherford? What brings you to the prop room? Where's your assistant?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "Didn't you receive Greta's notice on your terminals? She's already sent out compensation to everyone and officially disbanded the crew."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "Whether you're scared of the killer, worried about the Catastrophe, or want to stay and finish the shoot, we're all free to do as we please."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "So naturally it only took a blink of an eye for that spineless assistant of mine to run off god-knows-where."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "Do as we please?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "Don't tell me Miss Stone\u2014no, none of the crew even care about the real reason all these murders are happening?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "Frankly, my dear, I don't give a damn, and I don't see why you should either. Surely the reasonable thing to do is escape and leave that to the police?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "Or, as Greta said, you can leave the truth to whoever feels like playing detective."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "So, why'd you come looking for us, ma'am?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "I'm only here for you, Tippi, the background painter."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "I admire Greta's gumption in wanting to film a Catastrophe, and this is a fine opportunity for me as well, but films cannot rely solely on natural phenomena."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "I know you're more passionate about cinema than most, and you must have heard how important this project is to me."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Melanie",
        "text": "So I implore you, from the bottom of my heart, to put your talent in ambience-building and color-matching to work, and paint the perfect backdrop for my grand finale."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Wow..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "I mean, I'd totally love to, but..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.5
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#9$2",
            "duration": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "Go help her out, Tippi."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Hey, Molly, what's with the raincoat? Are you really going 'exploring'?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#9$2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "Mhm."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "Don't worry, I've been part of the prop team for ages now, and I know my way around the plate. I'll be fine."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Moira",
        "text": "Remember what we were just talking about? This is something I need to do."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Alright then."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tippi",
        "text": "Once I'm done helping out with the backdrops, I'll come find you, promise!"
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
